%% Behavior authority: blueprint/AGENTS.md (gate scope).
flowchart TB
  Member["Gate member"]
  Scope{"Requested scope<br/><small>Most specific setting wins</small>"}
  Files{"Can it take changed files?"}
  Projects{"Is its project unaffected?"}
  Changed["Changed files only"]
  Full["Full"]
  Skip["Skip"]
  Record["Record<br/><small>requested · resolved · why</small>"]

  Member --> Scope
  Scope -->|file| Files
  Scope -->|affected| Projects
  Scope -->|full| Full
  Files -->|Yes| Changed
  Files -->|"Yes, none changed"| Skip
  Files -->|"No or unknown"| Projects
  Projects -->|Yes| Skip
  Projects -->|"No or unknown"| Full
  Changed --> Record
  Full --> Record
  Skip --> Record

  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  class Files,Projects em
